To be stable, each one of them should fulfill and have eight bonds.

88
00:15:24,997 --> 00:15:32,747
The remaining bonds in orange at the surface is the free surface energy.

89
00:15:34,117 --> 00:15:41,717
For these atoms to be stable, it should attract anything, including dust,
