The surface tension of the liquid, some liquids having a higher interatomic bond
than others.

106
00:17:42,437 --> 00:17:50,817
These higher interatomic bond makes the drop of the liquid to be spherical or
tend to be spherical.

107
00:17:51,327 --> 00:17:53,717
It doesn't spread easily on the surface.

108
00:17:53,947 --> 00:18:03,067
Why? Because it is collimated or connected to each other that makes it rounded
or spherical drop.

109
