117
00:18:49,887 --> 00:18:50,827
How?

118
00:18:51,187 --> 00:18:54,707
When you triturate amalgam, it gains a frictional heat.

119
00:18:54,707 --> 00:19:17,497
This heat satisfies the atom to release from the bond, the atoms will have
excess energy that it will be released the surface the interatomic bond and
