127
00:20:03,777 --> 00:20:09,907
Imagine these surfaces and we have a drop of liquid that spread over it.

128
00:20:11,772 --> 00:20:12,172
Okay.

129
00:20:12,912 --> 00:20:14,592
This is what is called wetting.

130
00:20:15,132 --> 00:20:19,922
Where is the contact angle? It is the angle between the surface and the tangent
